{"name":"Chick Flick","hex":"#bf7d80","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"chick flick","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A film, typically about romance, which is generally more popular with women than men.","A sexually exploitative or pornographic film depicting women, intended for straight men."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chick_flick"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chick flick","blocks":[{"text":"Chick flick is a slang term for the film genre catered specifically to women's interests, and is marketed toward female demographics. They generally tend to appeal more to a younger female audience and deal mainly with love and romance. Although many types of films may be directed toward a female audience, the term \"chick flick\" is typically used only in reference to films that contain personal drama and emotion or themes that are relationship-based. Chick flicks often are released en masse around Valentine's Day."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chick_flick"},{"title":"Chick Flick (web series)","blocks":[{"text":"Chick Flick is a 2022 Indian Bengali language crime and comedy web series directed by Joydip Banerjee and written by Soumit Deb."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Chick_Flick_Poster.jpg/330px-Chick_Flick_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chick_Flick_(web_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Audrey_Hepburn_Tiffany%27s_4.jpg/330px-Audrey_Hepburn_Tiffany%27s_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Audrey_Hepburn_Tiffany%27s_4.jpg/330px-Audrey_Hepburn_Tiffany%27s_4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Audrey Hepburn in Breakfast at Tiffany's (1961), an early example of the chick flick","link":"htt